    pr_ref:  # 7a76
    description: "ADR-0061 ruling 3 (merged #1308). Every shipped catalogue file (every family registered in yaml_catalogs.YAML_CATALOGS) declares `provenance: builtin` or `provenance: community` in its header; a gate (in the style of test_catalogue_scope_gates.py) refuses a shipped file that declares neither, and refuses `builtin` on a file carrying a third-party module. A community file also carries a dated `retrieved:`.\nThis is the PREREQUISITE for the per-family community moves (they need the declaration to exist) and for INV-lamap (the loader reading tier from the declaration instead of the directory).\nAcceptance: the gate runs over every family's shipped files and is shown red by a mutation (drop one declaration; mark a file with a third-party row builtin)."  # 7a76
    fields: {}  # 7a76
